# shadcn CLI output. It cannot resolve this repo's `@` alias (solution-style
# root tsconfig, no `paths`), so `shadcn add` writes here instead of
# src/components/ui. Wanted files are copied into place by hand; this stays on
# disk as a reference copy for diffing the next `shadcn add`, untracked.
/@/
